# Testing Instructions — Personal Productivity App

## Prerequisites

```powershell
py -m pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## 1. Application Startup

```powershell
py run.py
```

- App launches showing a **split-pane layout** (sidebar left, editor right).
- Window title: "Personal Productivity App".
- Default size ~1200×800, minimum 900×600.
- Database `app.db` is created automatically in the project root.
- File `settings.json` is created on first launch.

---

## 2. Sidebar & Page Management

### Create a page
- Click **"+ New Page"** button → enter title → page appears in the tree.
- **Keyboard:** `Ctrl+N`.
- If one or more pages are **selected** in the tree, the new page is created as a **child** under each selected page.

### Create a child (nested) page
- Right-click a page → **"Add Child Page"** → enter title.
- **Keyboard:** `Ctrl+Shift+N` (when a page is loaded in the editor).

### Rename a page
- Right-click a page → **"Rename"** → enter new title.

### Delete a page (single)
- Right-click a page → **"Delete"** (no confirmation).
- **Keyboard:** `Delete` key (when the page is loaded in the editor, or when multiple pages are selected in the tree for bulk delete).
- Deletion is stored for **15 minutes** — use **Undo Delete** to restore.

### Multi-select & Bulk Delete
- **Ctrl+click** or **Shift+click** to select multiple pages in the tree.
- Right-click any selected page → **"Delete Selected (N)"** (no confirmation).
- **Keyboard:** `Delete`, `Ctrl+D` when multiple pages are selected.
- All deletions are captured as a single undoable action — one undo restores everything.

### Reorder pages
- Right-click a page → **"Move Up"** / **"Move Down"** (changes `sort_order`).

### Bulk create time-based pages
- Click **"Bulk Time-Based"** button, or **Edit → Bulk Create Pages** (`Ctrl+Shift+B`).
- Start and end date pre-filled. End date **dynamically adjusts** when start date changes: Days → +1 day, Weeks → +7 days, Years → +1 year.
- Three modes:
  | Mode | Output | Verification |
  |------|--------|-------------|
  | **Days** | One `YYYY-MM-DD` per day between start and end date | Count = (end - start).days + 1 |
  | **Weeks** | One `YYYY-MM-DD - YYYY-MM-DD` per week, snapped to chosen start-of-week day | First page starts on the correct weekday |
  | **Years** | One `YYYY` per year between start and end year | Count = end_year - start_year + 1 |

### Bulk create named pages
- Click **"+ Bulk Named"** button.
- Enter a **base name** and **number of pages**.
- Creates pages with sequential names: `BaseName 1`, `BaseName 2`, ..., `BaseName N`.

### Undo Delete
- **Edit → Undo Delete** (`Ctrl+Shift+Z`, `Ctrl+U`, or `Ctrl+Z` when sidebar has focus) restores deletions one at a time.
- Each press undoes the most recent deletion — press repeatedly to go further back.
- Works for: single page, bulk pages, content blocks, and individual tasks.
- Actions older than **15 minutes** are automatically discarded.
- After undo, the sidebar refreshes and the editor clears/resets.

### Expand / Collapse tree
- **"Show All"** / **"Hide All"** buttons in the sidebar expand or collapse all tree nodes.
- Manually collapsed branches stay collapsed across sidebar refreshes.

### Toggle sidebar visibility
- **View → Toggle Sidebar**.

